  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the Online Post Preference Form on its official website for the Recruitment of Junior Engineer Examination 2025<strong>.</strong> This recruitment was released for 1731 posts. Online registration process for SSC Junior Engineer JE Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 30 June 2025 to 21 July 2025. The Tier-II Exam was conducted on 07 April 2026. Candidates who qualified the Tier-I Examination can check the complete details for SSC Junior Engineer JE Tier-II Answer Key 2026 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC Junior Engineer Tier-II Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>30 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>21 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>22 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Correction Date : <strong>26-28 July 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><mark>Exam Date : <strong>03-06 December 2025</strong></mark></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>25 November 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Slot Selection Form Date&nbsp;<strong>: 28 November 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card :<em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em><strong>02 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key :<em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em><strong>19 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Paper-I Result : <strong>06 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Exam Date : <strong>07 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Exam City Details : <strong>27 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Admit Card : <strong>04 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Answer Key : <strong>16 April 2026</strong>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Preference Form:&nbsp;<strong>10-14 June 2026 (11:59 PM)</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Junior Engineer JE Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30-32 Years Post Wise</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC Junior Engineer JE Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Junior Engineer JE 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1731</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span st