tyle=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Electrical) </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.8859%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central Water Power Research Station </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6496%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Mechanical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.8859%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">DGQA-NAVAL, Ministry of Defence </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6496%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Electrical) </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">03 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.8859%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">DGQA-NAVAL, Ministry of Defence</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6496%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Mechanical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">05 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.8859%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Farakka Barrage Project, Ministry of Jal Shakti </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6496%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Civil)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">11</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.8859%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Farakka Barrage Project, Ministry of Jal Shakti </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6496%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Mechanical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.8859%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Military Engineer Service (MES) </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6496%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Civil) </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">202 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.8859%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Military Engineer Service (MES)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6496%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">JE (Electrical &amp; Mechanical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 21.4644%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">136 </span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Junior Engineer JE Online Form 2025 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Department Name&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Border Road Organization (BRO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed their BE / B.Tech Degree in Related Trade OR Diploma in Related Trade with 2 Year Experience&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central Public Works Department (CPWD)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have doon with Engineering Diploma in Related Trade will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central Water Commission (CWC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Engineering Degree / Diploma in Related Trade will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Farkka Barrage Project</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Engineering Diploma in Related Trade&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Military Engineer Services (MES)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Degree in Related Trade OR Engineering Diploma in Related Trade with 2 Year Experience&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">National Technical Research Organization (NTRO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Engineering Diploma in Related Trade&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ministry of Ports, Shipping &amp; Waterways (Andaman Lakshadweep Harbour Works)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Engineering Diploma in Related Trade&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.6753%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Department of Water Resources, River Development &amp; Ganga Rejuvenation (Brahmaputra Board)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.3247%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Engineering Diploma in Related Trade&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Check SSC Junior Engineer JE Tier-II Answer Key 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download SSC JE Tier-II Answer Key link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size